{%- comment -%}
  Master shade → hex map for ST London variants (plus the KJ demo shades).
  Outputs the 7-char hex for a known shade name, or nothing if unmapped.
  Lookup is O(1) via string contains — every entry is ;name:#RRGGBB.

  Usage:
  {%- capture hex -%}{% render 'kj-shade-hex', shade: variant.title %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign kj_key = shade | downcase | strip -%}
